    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="27.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 27.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he medrenmægas nage, gielden þa gegildan healfne, for healfne he fleo.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he has no maternal kin, let the associates pay half, for half let him flee.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he has no maternal relatives, his associates shall pay half [the wergeld], and in default of payment of the [other] half, he shall be held personally responsible.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he medrenmagas nage, gilden ða gegildan healfne, ond for healfne he fleo.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
